{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120111453191-1120_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261120095412\"/><p>美國總統特朗普日前曾指可能在中國與北韓領袖金正恩會面，惟最終沒有成事。特朗普周四（19日）離開深圳前向美媒指，雖然今次未能與金正恩會晤，但總有一天會成事。</p><p>特朗普指，他與金正恩保持良好關係，但APEC峰會期間有太多會議，未能成事，總有一天會舉行美朝會談。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:44:11.932187+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T03:14:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:57:17.149968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T03:37:28.512711+00:00","content_hash":"7dc7a47960bfd4ac34cd9b71f815c2531a9613648b72c78042dbe0282bb200dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T03:44:11.932187+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}